# Computer-Assisted Test Assembly Using Optimization Heuristics.

**Authors:** Leucht, Richard M.

## Abstract
Presents a variation of a &quot;greedy&quot; algorithm that can be used in test-assembly problems. The algorithm, the normalized weighted absolute-deviation heuristic, selects items to have a locally optimal fit to a moving set of average criterion values. Demonstrates application of the model. (SLD)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ594319

